1108:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @param  SmoothCalibPeriod Select the Smooth Calibration Period.
1109:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be can be one of the following values :
1110:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *             @arg RTC_SMOOTHCALIB_PERIOD_32SEC: The smooth calibration period is 32s.
1111:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *             @arg RTC_SMOOTHCALIB_PERIOD_16SEC: The smooth calibration period is 16s.
1112:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *             @arg RTC_SMOOTHCALIB_PERIOD_8SEC: The smooth calibration period is 8s.
1113:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @param  SmoothCalibPlusPulses Select to Set or reset the CALP bit.
1114:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
1115:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *             @arg RTC_SMOOTHCALIB_PLUSPULSES_SET: Add one RTCCLK pulse every 2*11 pulses.
1116:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *             @arg RTC_SMOOTHCALIB_PLUSPULSES_RESET: No RTCCLK pulses are added.
1117:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @param  SmoothCalibMinusPulsesValue Select the value of CALM[8:0] bits.
1118:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *          This parameter can be one any value from 0 to 0x000001FF.
1119:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @note   To deactivate the smooth calibration, the field SmoothCalibPlusPulses
1120:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *         must be equal to SMOOTHCALIB_PLUSPULSES_RESET and the field
1121:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *         SmoothCalibMinusPulsesValue must be equal to 0.
1122:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @retval HAL status
1123:Drivers/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   */
